      "expr": "(reduce (fn (acc x) (+ acc (+ x (+ x (+ x (+ x x)))))) 0 (range 1000))",
      "budget": {
        "fuel": 1
      },
      "error": "FUEL",
      "spec": "\u00a79, \u00a79.1",
      "note": "Asks for fuel 1, which every host clamps up to the 10 000 floor, and then does ~15 000 node visits \u2014 over the floor under the *cheapest* accounting \u00a79.1 permits (one step per node visited), so every conforming host reports FUEL. The step it fires at is deliberately not pinned; the code is."
    },
